<title>POLAND: ECHO SIGNS PLN 75 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>ECHO SIGNS PLN 75 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish developer Echo Investment SA signed an agreement with firm MDP Sp. zoo to build a hotel-office-retail complex in the central Polish city of Lodz worth 75 million zlotys, Echo said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Echo gave no other details about the deal.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
